{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been imprisoned in the royal dungeon. Forced to participate in weekly gladiatorial combat, you will surely die unless you make some powerful friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your day-to-day life in the dungeon, date your fellow inmates (who are monsters) and fight by their side to survive and escape in this innovative time-management dating-sim RPG where every choice matters and every playthrough is different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live your day-to-day life as a prisoner in a dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully manage your time, for it is limited</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date your inmates, who are monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight by their side in gladiatorial combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to keep them alive...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or live with the consequences of your actions</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824760?t=1764275236","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824760?t=1764275236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824760/fb34b878b6968d289723dd124718d8b83167e8fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764275236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824760/fb34b878b6968d289723dd124718d8b83167e8fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764275236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game includes content such as descriptions of violence, profanity, sexual themes and sexual innuendo."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been imprisoned in the royal dungeon. Forced to participate in weekly gladiatorial combat, you will surely d